<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-044" chapter-id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan" source-id="s-nanshi-044-zijing-nan-ws2027785">
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">先是<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p001:m0002" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">子敬</persName>所生早亡，帝命<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p001:m0011" ref="xbm_e9e_uv2">貴妃范氏</persName>母養之，及<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p001:m0020" ref="xbm_e9e_uv2">范氏</persName>薨，而子及婦服制，禮無明文。永明中，尚書令<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p001:m0043" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">王儉</persName>議：「孫為慈孫，婦為慈婦，姑為慈姑，宜制期年服。」從之。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初，<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p002:m0002" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">子敬</persName>為武帝所留心，帝不豫，有意立<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p002:m0018" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">子敬</persName>為太子，代太孫。<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p002:m0028" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">子敬</persName>與太孫俱入參畢同出，武帝目送<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p002:m0044" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">子敬</persName>良久，曰：「<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zijing-nan:p002:m0052" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">阿五</persName>鈍。」由此代換之意乃息。</p>
</text>
